# Native read-only pages (task 014 P3a), in a release build (APPLAUNCH_DEV=0: migrated pages show there, the
# unmigrated ones are hidden): System > Storage (the harness has no SD card: its "unavailable" line), Licenses (a
# TextBlock: as opened, three Down presses, then a drag), About (the board row: APPLAUNCH_BOARD is set here at every
# size, the Pi 3A+ profile's own label at 480x320), User (the account read in the background) and Date & Time > Info
# (refreshed every second). Info rows: key left, value right; on 480x320 (Compact) a long value wraps onto a second
# line (User: Password). Review only: no golden; every header is checked
# against the home grid's (run.sh header).
title settings native info pages
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
@640x480,800x480,720x720,1280x720 env APPLAUNCH_BOARD harness-board
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home
launch Settings
# System: Up from Screen wraps to the last section
key UP
key ENTER
# System (release): Storage, Licenses, About, Pointer navigation, SSH indicator, On-screen keyboard, Reboot, Shutdown
key ENTER
shot info_storage
header info_storage "Settings > System > Storage" "System > Storage" Storage
key ESC
key DOWN
key ENTER
shot info_licenses
header info_licenses "Settings > System > Licenses" "System > Licenses" Licenses
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
wait 300
shot info_licenses_scrolled
drag 240 280 240 120
shot info_licenses_dragged
key ESC
key DOWN
key ENTER
shot info_about
header info_about "Settings > System > About" "System > About" About
# Down moves the highlight through the table (no action on a row)
key DOWN
key DOWN
shot info_about_moved
key ESC
key ESC
# root: System selected; Up twice: Date & Time, then User
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot info_user
header info_user "Settings > User" User
key ESC
key DOWN
key ENTER
# Date & Time: Info, Network Time, Set Manually
key ENTER
wait 1200
shot info_datetime
header info_datetime "Settings > Date & Time > Info" "Date & Time > Info" Info
